Expose read-only SBC/LDAC encoder state and real ABR transitions.

The stats are bounded atomic observations; no D-Bus events or filesystem writes
run on the audio thread. Active clears on encoder cleanup, and consumers must
also bind observations to the active PCM/daemon lifetime. Other codecs retain
zero/unknown telemetry. This does not qualify any physical link or codec.

